  "prefLabel": "Bfc 105.01 Meetings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bfc 105.01 Meetings.\n\n(a) The board shall meet 4 times per year and at such additional times as shall be called for by the chair or by vote of the board.\n\n(b) The board shall hold an annual meeting in March of each year for the purpose of electing a vice-chair.\n\nSource. #10553-A, eff 3-25-14",
